  "prefLabel": "Jus 1602.07 Law enforcement officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1602.07 “Law enforcement officer” means any officer of the state or political subdivision of the state whom is empowered by law to conduct investigations of or to make arrests for offenses enumerated in RSA 318-B:2.\n\nSource. #10177, eff 8-23-12; ss by #13551, eff 2-2-23 (formerly Jus 1602.06)",
